          "value": "<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f8791141-7fff-6b57-385a-bfad9fcb48a3\"></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">As per the champion-tier feat, but you keep raging even when at negative hit points.</p>"
